Although there are some [wrapper package](https://github.com/vrischmann/zig-sqlite) options for SQLite in Zig, they are unstable. So here we will introduce the [C API interface](https://www.sqlite.org/cintro.html) via `addTranslateC`.

Data models are introduced in the Database section.

